<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49711" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰάπτω</span></b>  (B) <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῐ]</span>, fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ψω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					525
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.): aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴαψα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					700
				</span></i>
			(lyr.): —<i>send, drive on</i>, of missiles,
				<i>send forth, shoot</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόξοις βέλη εἴς τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					510
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερμάδα ἐπί τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Th.</u>
					299
				</span></i>
			(lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόσθε πυλᾶν κεφαλὰν
			ἰ</span>. to <i>throw</i> his head before the gates, i.e. lose
			it, ib.<i><span class="en">
				525
			</span></i>(lyr.): metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτύμβιον αἶνον ἐπ᾽ ἀνδρὶ θείῳ . .
					ἰάπτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1548
				</span></i>
			(lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μακάρεσσιν ἔπι ψόγον αἰνὸν
				ἰ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Rhian.
				1.4
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. ὀρχήματα</span>
			<i>begin</i> the dance, S.l.c.:— 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί τινι ἰάπτεται βέλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					544
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc.
			objecti, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγοις ἰάπτειν τινά</span>
			<i>assail</i> one with words, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				501
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr. (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑαυτόν</span>), <i>rush, hurry</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				547
			</span></i> (lyr.). (Perh. cf. Lat. <i>jacio.</i>)</div>
